## 8. Branches and PRs

- Work on a short branch from `{{MAIN_BRANCH}}`. Keep PRs small, less than about 400 changed lines.
- Each PR passes the CI gate and the PR loop before {{DECIDER}} merges.
- Never force-push to `{{MAIN_BRANCH}}`. Never skip a test to make CI pass.

## 9. End of each session

1. Make sure each work item has a work-log entry.
2. Add the conversation summary to `CONVERSATIONS.md`.
3. Add revisit-log entries for new ideas, with {{DECIDER}}'s decision.
4. Update the plan status in the plan index, if it changed.
5. Commit, then open or update the PR.
6. Tell {{DECIDER}} the open items and the next step.

## 10. Changes to this file

This file changes only through a PR that {{DECIDER}} approves.
